rizontal cylinder; browser uses&lt;br&gt;the C4 window. Solid blue/neutral frames = logical/placement scope; dotted frames = organization. Arrows show named directed interactions. Font contrast is&lt;br&gt;adapted; sizes fit text, not quantity." c4Type="annotation"><mxCell style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#404040;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="686" width="1620" height="106" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="meta_attribution" label="C4: Simon Brown, CC BY 4.0. Shape assets adapted from draw.io C4, Apache-2.0." c4Type="annotation"><mxCell style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#404040;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="812" width="1620" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>